      "id": "end-state-is-the-hotels-page",
      "desc": "结束状态是酒店页（记录按钮在，机票摘要的记录按钮不在），不是停在摘要页",
      "signal": {
        "all_of": [
          {
            "css_exists": "#record-all"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "css_exists": "#record-fare"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "recorded-for-the-frozen-checkin",
      "desc": "记录的正是包里那一行入住日（2026-10-07），不是别的日期",
      "signal": {
        "css_text_contains": [
          "#log",
          "2026-10-07"
        ]
